Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:06.48,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 1/4决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:06.48,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}蒂亚福 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6(2) {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}5{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 穆塞蒂 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.56,0:00:02.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Francis, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.56,0:00:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:04.10,EN,,0,0,0,,There's been lightning in the area,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:04.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一带打雷了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.10,0:00:06.44,EN,,0,0,0,,there was electricity on the court tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.10,0:00:06.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚球场上也是电光四射
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:07.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Talk us through the last few games
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:07.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟我们说说最后几局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:09.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and how you managed those emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么控制住情绪的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I thought I played a great first match point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得那分赛点打得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Missed the backhand,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,反手打丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.74,EN,,0,0,0,,just overcooked the backhand,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,反手发力太猛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:19.16,EN,,0,0,0,,had a pick up and you know got broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:19.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手接了一拍 然后我被破发了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:22.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I did play a great game and break back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我马上打了一局 破回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:24.12,EN,,0,0,0,,So did I there at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后那一刻也是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:25.86,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean look, he's a hell of a player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:25.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,他真的是个厉害的选手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.24,EN,,0,0,0,,We've been at the top for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们都在这个位置打了挺久
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:28.06,EN,,0,0,0,,He's gonna make you beat him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:28.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,他会逼着你去赢下他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:29.56,EN,,0,0,0,,and that's what I did tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:29.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这就是我今晚做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:29.94,EN,,0,0,0,,What did you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:29.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在这场比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.94,0:00:31.38,EN,,0,0,0,,have to figure out strategically
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.94,0:00:31.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,战术上想清楚了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:32.72,EN,,0,0,0,,over the course of the match?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:32.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,才走到这一步？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:34.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I just got to play the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:34.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是想着去赢下这场球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:36.60,EN,,0,0,0,,You know we're all long seasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.60,0:00:36.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,整个赛季都很长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:37.50,EN,,0,0,0,,We're all just at one percent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:37.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家其实都差那么一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:39.28,EN,,0,0,0,,just trying to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,都在摸索怎么突破
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Guy who just plays a little more brave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,谁在关键时刻更敢打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:41.92,EN,,0,0,0,,at certain moments gets it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:41.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,谁就能拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:43.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and I was hitting my shots great tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚我击球状态很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:44.64,EN,,0,0,0,,From back in the court I've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:44.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,底线相持这块
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:45.22,EN,,0,0,0,,been playing really well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:45.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直打得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:47.58,EN,,0,0,0,,so I was just counting on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:47.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以就靠这个撑下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:49.96,EN,,0,0,0,,You've been to the final here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你以前打进过这里的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.68,EN,,0,0,0,,How much does that help you for what's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这段经历对你接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:52.76,EN,,0,0,0,,to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:52.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,有多大帮助？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Every match is its own story,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,每场比赛都是独立的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:55.92,EN,,0,0,0,,its own journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,各走各的路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:57.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm just happy to be another semi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,能再进一次半决赛就很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:01:00.50,EN,,0,0,0,,get a chance to be in the final, hopefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:01:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望还能有机会打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm just gonna go out there and compete
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来我就是全力去拼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,as hard as I can and give myself a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,给自己争取一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:04.98,EN,,0,0,0,,That's all I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:04.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,我能做的就是这些
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,真棒
